#: includes/eme-actions.php:594
msgid "<p>Hey, <strong>%1$s</strong>, welcome to <strong>Events Made Easy</strong>! We hope you like it around here.</p><p>Now it's time to insert events lists through <a href='%2$s' title='%3$s'>widgets</a>, <a href='%4$s' title='%5$s'>template tags</a> or <a href='%6$s' title='%7$s'>shortcodes</a>.</p><p>By the way, have you taken a look at the <a href='%8$s' title='%9$s'>Settings page</a>? That's where you customize the way events and locations are displayed.</p><p>What? Tired of seeing this advice? I hear you, <a href='#' class='eme-dismiss-notice' data-notice='hello' title='%10$s'>click here</a> and you won't see this again!</p>"
msgstr "<p>Ahoj, <strong>%1$s</strong>, vítejte v pluginu <strong>Events Made Easy</strong>! Doufáme, že se vám tu bude líbit.</p><p>Nyní je čas vložit seznamy událostí pomocí <a href='%2$s' title='%3$s'>widgetů</a>, <a href='%4$s' title='%5$s'>značek šablon</a> nebo <a href='%6$s' title='%7$s'>shortcodů</a>.</p><p>Mimochodem, podívali jste se na <a href='%8$s' title='%9$s'>stránku Nastavení</a>? Tam si můžete přizpůsobit způsob zobrazení událostí a umístění.</p><p>Co? Už vás nebaví vidět tuto radu? Chápu, <a href='#' class='eme-dismiss-notice' data-notice='hello' title='%10$s'>klikněte sem</a> a už ji znovu neuvidíte!</p>"

#: includes/eme-actions.php:618
msgid "If you find <strong>Events Made Easy</strong> useful to you, please consider making a small donation to help contribute to my time invested and to further development. Thanks for your kind support!"
msgstr "Pokud pro vás je plugin <strong>Events Made Easy</strong> užitečný, zvažte prosím malý dar na podporu mého času a dalšího vývoje. Děkujeme za vaši podporu!"

#. translators: %s is the name of the settings option
#: events-manager.php:395
msgid "Error: the special events page is not set or no longer exist, please set the option '%s' to an existing page or EME will not work correctly!"
